<title>USA: NICOR Inc Q4 net lower, revenues higher.</title>
<headline>NICOR Inc Q4 net lower, revenues higher.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.71		  $  0.71</p>
<p> Net			 35,100		   35,700</p>
<p> Revs		     592,900		  466,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,600		   50,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income excludes preferred dividends of $100,000 in each year.  </p>
