<p>NOTE: 1996 year net includes income from discontinued operations of $15 million or $0.30 a share.</p>
<p>Net income for year excludes preferred dividends of $400,000 in each year.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
